WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.012
I am Hope.

00:00:01.012 --> 00:00:03.594
Long ago I was a young blue whale.

00:00:03.594 --> 00:00:06.176
On the morning of 25 March 1891, I

00:00:06.176 --> 00:00:08.980
stranded on a sandbar at the mouth of

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.296
Wexford Harbour, in Ireland.

00:00:11.746 --> 00:00:14.660
My skeleton was sold to the museum for

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:15.557
250 pounds.

00:00:15.557 --> 00:00:18.247
In July 2017 I was unveiled here in

00:00:18.247 --> 00:00:19.218
Hintze Hall.

00:00:19.218 --> 00:00:21.609
They named me Hope: a symbol of

00:00:21.609 --> 00:00:24.598
humanity's power to shape a sustainable

00:00:24.598 --> 00:00:25.371
future.
